      propertyPath: npcTask
      value: "The player has to help you with giving inspiration for boats. You just
        told the player that they now have to select 1 of the boats behind you. \r\nHe/
        she does that in the same way as grabbing an object from a distance.\r\n\r\nOnce
        the player has selected 1 of the boats, they have to play with the specific
        boatparts to create a unique boat.\r\n\r\nIf the players doesn't know what
        to do, repeat/ remind them about the task about selecting a boat that they
        have to do."
